{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic 2D brawler, you\u2019re not just fighting, you\u2019re reacting, adapting, and outsmarting your opponents using physics, the environment, and a ridiculous array of weapons. With two hand slots and total freedom to mix tools and elements on the fly, every match becomes a dynamic playground of mayhem and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Specific Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9689d698d0e8ed8e21621686a3b8abb2.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=870 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/0802ad26e768168f9de7f6aa861041fd.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=866 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawler Battle up to 4 local player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/fe1b8230aa2caf33fc68a4271547984b.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=931 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Steam's Remote Play Together to play online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 battles grounds each with a different themes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush Cave with Camp Fire and Waterfall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/18793314ad45d0ba40eae22ee8b02355.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1000 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple with Dark Smoke and Arrow Traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/4ef2391bfb51d907a7d714d14d1bbbb7.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1076 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antartica with permanent ice platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/0ea73045166fa37ebbbbf1e223454dfd.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1137 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Wielding &amp; Weapon Combos</strong>: <i>Combine any two weapons for unique effects and strategies.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Air Flow Simulatio</strong>n: <i>Fire, cold, and environmental objects constantly reshape the battlefield.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Bubble States</strong>: <i>Heat, cold, and water all affect movement, abilities, and tactics.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Arena</strong>: <i>All projectiles, smoke, and even the bubbles themselves react to the simulated air flow.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP : Last Man Standing Chaotic Multiplayer Battle</strong>: <i>Easy to learn, hard to master. Perfect for couch play or online competition.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVE : Work Together Against Waves of Enemies</strong>: <i>Easy to learn, hard to master. Perfect for couch play or online competition.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual-Wielding, Element-Mixing Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bubble Gun, every player can hold two weapons at once. Firing both simultaneously doesn\u2019t just double your firepower\u2014it combines the effects of both weapons for unpredictable results.<br><br><strong>Here are a few examples:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite your bullets by pairing Fire and Bullet, creating bouncing flaming projectiles that ricochet across the arena. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix Fire and Water for deadly steam clouds that fill the battlefield. Every combination leads to unique tactics and opportunities for creative mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze some water and you can build a defensive wall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a flame thrower, no problem. Use environmental water to create steam against your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic, Real-Time Air Flow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Bubble Gun is alive with moving air. Fire weapons, ice guns, and even fans all push and pull the air around in real time, affecting everything in the arena. If a flame thrower sets a room ablaze, hot air rises, smoke billows, and bubbles drift differently. A blast of cold can freeze the air, causing bubbles to become sluggish and heavy. Every round plays out differently as players and environmental hazards constantly reshape the airflow, keeping everyone on their toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=640 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moving a flame affects airflow in real time</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Effects on Bubbles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubble Gun arena is more than just a backdrop, it's a dynamic, interactive playground. Both the player bubbles and environmental effects like steam and smoke are physically simulated and react to the air. Every element changes how you move and fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat: Makes bubbles lighter than air, unable to stick to surfaces, and float unpredictably. You become a drifting target\u2014harder to hit, but harder to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold: Freezes bubbles, making them heavy and hard to float or maneuver. Frozen bubbles can\u2019t move on the ground, forcing you to think ahead and avoid icy traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water: Soaks bubbles, making them too heavy to float but letting you roll and slide along the ground. Water opens up new movement options\u2014and new vulnerabilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes Bubble Gun different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Gun stands out with its deep, physics-driven interactions and wild, unpredictable battles. Instead of preset combos or limited loadouts, players are encouraged to experiment. The ever-changing air flow system makes every round unique.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a button-masher. Victory in Bubble Gun means reading the arena, improvising, and using elemental combos at just the right time. With quick rounds, a variety of weapons and arenas, and local or online multiplayer, Bubble Gun is perfect for parties, competitive players, and anyone who loves fast-paced, chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920750?t=1755076330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/ddcb125bfb1d348b51c598373191ade4c2be0e65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755076330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/d90ffe65fd7d194f14b48373327b4b1d5fd66563/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755076330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/d90ffe65fd7d194f14b48373327b4b1d5fd66563/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755076330","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic 2D brawler, you\u2019re not just fighting, you\u2019re reacting, adapting, and outsmarting your opponents using physics, the environment, and a ridiculous array of weapons. With two hand slots and total freedom to mix tools and elements on the fly, every match becomes a dynamic playground of mayhem and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/ef98e25b29337ebdbf12275e1132b3bf.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Specific Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9689d698d0e8ed8e21621686a3b8abb2.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=870 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/0802ad26e768168f9de7f6aa861041fd.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=866 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawler Battle up to 4 local player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/fe1b8230aa2caf33fc68a4271547984b.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=931 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support Steam's Remote Play Together to play online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 battles grounds each with a different themes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush Cave with Camp Fire and Waterfall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/18793314ad45d0ba40eae22ee8b02355.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1000 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temple with Dark Smoke and Arrow Traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/4ef2391bfb51d907a7d714d14d1bbbb7.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1076 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antartica with permanent ice platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/0ea73045166fa37ebbbbf1e223454dfd.avif?t=1755076330\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1137 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Wielding &amp; Weapon Combos</strong>: <i>Combine any two weapons for unique effects and strategies.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Air Flow Simulatio</strong>n: <i>Fire, cold, and environmental objects constantly reshape the battlefield.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Bubble States</strong>: <i>Heat, cold, and water all affect movement, abilities, and tactics.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Arena</strong>: <i>All projectiles, smoke, and even the bubbles themselves react to the simulated air flow.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP : Last Man Standing Chaotic Multiplayer Battle</strong>: <i>Easy to learn, hard to master. Perfect for couch play or online competition.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVE : Work Together Against Waves of Enemies</strong>: <i>Easy to learn, hard to master. Perfect for couch play or online competition.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual-Wielding, Element-Mixing Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bubble Gun, every player can hold two weapons at once. Firing both simultaneously doesn\u2019t just double your firepower\u2014it combines the effects of both weapons for unpredictable results.<br><br><strong>Here are a few examples:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite your bullets by pairing Fire and Bullet, creating bouncing flaming projectiles that ricochet across the arena. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/6457a10dd934e7abcbe8e1c6d61e0f8c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix Fire and Water for deadly steam clouds that fill the battlefield. Every combination leads to unique tactics and opportunities for creative mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/c3c292efeb97d8924c4d92be44e831da.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze some water and you can build a defensive wall. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/2fa92109e7b976c7fe1b8e8d7a8397e6.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have a flame thrower, no problem. Use environmental water to create steam against your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/3ec9533967debda8f2b3e532b89a131c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic, Real-Time Air Flow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Bubble Gun is alive with moving air. Fire weapons, ice guns, and even fans all push and pull the air around in real time, affecting everything in the arena. If a flame thrower sets a room ablaze, hot air rises, smoke billows, and bubbles drift differently. A blast of cold can freeze the air, causing bubbles to become sluggish and heavy. Every round plays out differently as players and environmental hazards constantly reshape the airflow, keeping everyone on their toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=640 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/dc51022c9e9622483009500af6ac5ce4.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moving a flame affects airflow in real time</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Effects on Bubbles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubble Gun arena is more than just a backdrop, it's a dynamic, interactive playground. Both the player bubbles and environmental effects like steam and smoke are physically simulated and react to the air. Every element changes how you move and fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat: Makes bubbles lighter than air, unable to stick to surfaces, and float unpredictably. You become a drifting target\u2014harder to hit, but harder to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/02f3219d0d69f09790349b2d289db002.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold: Freezes bubbles, making them heavy and hard to float or maneuver. Frozen bubbles can\u2019t move on the ground, forcing you to think ahead and avoid icy traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/199946989f06e24b1d85f73962d8cc0c.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water: Soaks bubbles, making them too heavy to float but letting you roll and slide along the ground. Water opens up new movement options\u2014and new vulnerabilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/b306b8cf0435b9fb5be278076b13b7b4.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes Bubble Gun different?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Gun stands out with its deep, physics-driven interactions and wild, unpredictable battles. Instead of preset combos or limited loadouts, players are encouraged to experiment. The ever-changing air flow system makes every round unique.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a button-masher. Victory in Bubble Gun means reading the arena, improvising, and using elemental combos at just the right time. With quick rounds, a variety of weapons and arenas, and local or online multiplayer, Bubble Gun is perfect for parties, competitive players, and anyone who loves fast-paced, chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.poster.avif?t=1755076330\" width=480 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.webm?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/extras/9a22e381ea0a341816ece63632bf6845.mp4?t=1755076330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Emergence Ltd"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3859320","name":"Bubble Gun"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920750/978e49a5827d509776d896ae50b0059349be85c1/header.jpg?t=1755076330","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Digital Emergence Ltd. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nBubble Gun\u2122 is a trademark of Digital Emergence Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Zen\u202f2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RDNA\u202f2 GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257177573,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177573/movie480.mp4?t=1755076258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177573/movie_max.mp4?t=1755076258"},"name":"BubbleGun Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177573/acc84e23aa0b572c78ae83fd91f049ca701631cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755076258","webm":{"480":"ht